# Only the project goes into the repository. Everything else in this folder (your own
# vaults, their graphs, LightRAG stores, the Python environment) stays out, including
# anything you add later. To publish a new top-level file or folder, add a "!/name" line here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/docker-compose*.yml
!/src/
!/tests/
!/guides/
!/assets/
!/examples/
!/skills/

# A private house style for the viewer (src/kg_view.py uses its built-in style without it)
proto-ui.css

# Generated anywhere: graphs next to a vault, caches, LightRAG stores
*-kg/
.cache/
rag/
rag_storage/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

*.env